# WARP-8: the second octave's keys on the Throws page (FX held) are twelve more throws on the kit: thin, roll, buzz,
# soft, rise, drop, down on the white keys; low-pass, delay, reverb, hard, crush on the black
wait 300
listen
expect trk 1
# a kick on every step of the bar: sixteen hits a bar, 125 ms a step
tapkey b0
tapkey w0
tapkey w1
tapkey w2
tapkey w3
tapkey w4
tapkey w5
tapkey w6
tapkey w7
tapkey w8
tapkey w9
tapkey w10
tapkey w11
tapkey w12
tapkey w13
tapkey w14
tapkey w15
expect drumhits 1
# two bars as written: 32 hits
tap PLAY
wait 3900
tap PLAY
expect drumhits 33
# thin (white 8): only the eighths: 16 in two bars
press FX
key w7 down
wait 60
expect page Throws
tap PLAY
wait 3900
tap PLAY
expect drumhits 49
shot throws2.png
key w7 up
# buzz (white 10): each hit twice
key w9 down
wait 60
tap PLAY
wait 1900
tap PLAY
expect drumhits 81
key w9 up
# the black keys of the second octave reach the engine (low-pass, delay, reverb, crush): held and let go
key b6 down
wait 100
expect punch_mel >0
key b6 up
key b9 down
wait 100
expect punch_mel >0
key b9 up
wait 60
expect punch_mel 0
release FX
wait 40
expect page Steps
